    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i had a really weird thing happen about an hour ago. my vision in my right eye just went all blurry and fuzzy for like two mins, and my right hand felt super clumsy like i couldnt grip stuff right. but it stopped completely and i feel totally fine now. should i be worried or is it probably nothing?",
